The CSV tables in this directory are derived from the ReMIND database
(Juvekar et al., The Cancer Imaging Archive, DOI 10.7937/3RAG-D070), which is
distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(CC BY 4.0). As a derived work they are released under the same licence.

Attribution required:

  Juvekar, P., Dorent, R., Kögl, F., et al. (2023). The Brain Resection
  Multimodal Imaging Database (ReMIND) (Version 1) [Data set].
  The Cancer Imaging Archive. https://doi.org/10.7937/3RAG-D070

Full licence: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The code that produced these tables is licensed separately; see ../LICENSE.
